/-- **Inbound bridge #3** — Sakharov realisation at `N` ⇒ cycle-33
    `baryogenesis_leptogenesis_paper_bundle` (at the same `N`).

    Alkes' grand cycle-33 headline holds unconditionally for every
    `N`; the bridge realises an APPLIES edge from the Sakharov-
